                    <h2 class="section-title">1. Introduction & Scope</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="section-body">
                    <p>
                        Welcome to <strong>Menhaty ("منحتي")</strong>. This Privacy Policy describes how Menhaty collects, uses, protects, and discloses personal information through our mobile application for iOS and Android, as well as related scholarship management services.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        By accessing or using the Menhaty application, you acknowledge and agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with this policy, please discontinue using the application or request account deletion as outlined below.
