                    <h2 class="section-title">2. Information We Collect</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="section-body">
                    <p>We only collect information necessary to deliver educational grant and scholarship services:</p>
                    <ul class="policy-list">
                        <li><strong>Personal Identification Data:</strong> Full name, verified email address, phone number, username, and encrypted credentials.</li>
                        <li><strong>Academic Records:</strong> Educational institution, faculty, major, academic level/year, Grade Point Average (GPA), academic transcripts, and official verification certificates.</li>
                        <li><strong>Grant & Financial Request Data:</strong> Monthly stipend applications, tuition fee payment requests, housing/dormitory allowances, and graduation expense records.</li>
                        <li><strong>Uploaded Files & Media:</strong> User-selected images and documents (such as PDF files and JPEG/PNG receipts or certificates) that the user intentionally uploads for grant qualification.</li>
                        <li><strong>Technical & Diagnostics Information:</strong> Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) push token, mobile operating system version (iOS/Android), application version, and anonymized diagnostic crash logs.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- 3. How We Use Your Data -->
            <article class="policy-card" id="en-sec-3">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <div class="section-icon">
