                    <h2 class="section-title">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="section-body">
                    <p>We process collected data exclusively for lawful academic and grant management purposes:</p>
                    <ul class="policy-list">
                        <li>To authenticate student identity and confirm active scholarship eligibility.</li>
                        <li>To review, process, and approve financial requests, tuition allowances, and hostel applications.</li>
                        <li>To deliver essential push notifications regarding application decisions, allowance approvals, or admin notices.</li>
                        <li>To enable direct official communication between students and scholarship supervisors.</li>
                        <li>To protect account integrity, prevent unauthorized access, and troubleshoot application performance.</li>
                        <li><strong>Explicit Commitment:</strong> We do not sell, rent, license, or monetize your personal data to third parties, advertisers, or data brokers.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </article>

