                            <li>Tap on <strong>"Delete Account"</strong> (حذف الحساب).</li>
                            <li>Read the confirmation notice and tap <strong>"Confirm"</strong>.</li>
                            <li>You will be immediately logged out, and your deletion request will be submitted to the administration for permanent execution.</li>
