                <div class="section-body">
                    <p>
                        We employ rigorous technical and organizational security controls to protect student data against unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="policy-list">
                        <li><strong>End-to-End Transport Encryption:</strong> All data transmitted between the client mobile application and our servers is secured with HTTPS/TLS encryption.</li>
                        <li><strong>Secure On-Device Storage:</strong> Auth tokens are stored in the iOS Keychain via secure storage libraries; sensitive credentials are never stored in plain text.</li>
                        <li><strong>Role-Based Access Control:</strong> Student academic files are strictly restricted to authorized scholarship coordinators and program administrators.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </article>

